# Allowlist: send Docker only what the image build needs. Everything else,
# including any new file someone adds later (secrets, local data), stays out by default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src

# Drop local bytecode caches from src/ so they don't change the COPY layer.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[oc]
